// `prediction.boxes` contains the coordinates of detected objects
for box in prediction.boxes {
    let xMin = box.xMin
    let yMin = box.yMin
    let width = box.width
    let height = box.height

    // Use these coordinates to draw bounding boxes on your image
}
```

Ensure you have the correct input format for `YOLOv8sInput` and handle any necessary preprocessing of images before passing them to the model. For more details, refer to the [Core ML documentation](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/coreml).

