Laravel Unable to retrieve the file_size for file at location

I am trying to download a file from local storage but keep getting the error: Unable to retrieve the file_size for file at location.
 if (file_exists($filePath)) {
 return Storage::download($filePath, $fileName);
 }

The file path is tested prior to make sure the file exists.
The error is being thrown from vendor/league/flysystem-local/LocalFilesystemAdapter.php line 418.
